OL,3,GNEWSAMan barricaded in house threatens
OL,4,Ato start fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say a man who has been
OL,7,Fbarricaded in a house for more than 24
OL,8,Fhours is threatening to "set fire to
OL,9,Fit" if anyone enters.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to a property on
OL,12,FCoast Road, Hopton-on-Sea, near Great
OL,13,FYarmouth, shortly after 11:30 GMT on
OL,14,FWednesday, following reports a man had
OL,15,Fmade threats when attempts had been
OL,16,Fmade to evict him.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
