OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1793883362
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan barricaded in house threatens
OL,4,Ato start fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Norfolk Police said:
OL,7,F"When officers arrived on scene, the
OL,8,Fman was locked inside his address,
OL,9,Frefused to leave and said he had
OL,10,Fcontainers of petrol in the property
OL,11,Fthat he would set fire to if anyone
OL,12,Fentered."
OL,14,FHopton Church of England Primary
OL,15,FAcademy opposite the property was
OL,16,Fevacuated in response and the county
OL,17,Fcouncil advised it would remain closed
OL,18,Fon Thursday "as a precautionary
OL,19,Fmeasure".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
